<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57087" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηκίς</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῖδος</span>, ἡ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything
				gushing</i> or <i>bubbling forth, ooze</i>, of fat or juices
			drawn forth by fire, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηκὶς πισσήρης φλογός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					268
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. φόνου</span>
			<i>bubbling</i> blood, ib.<i><span class="en">
				1012
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυδῶσα κ.</span>
			<i>juices</i> drawn by fire from a sacrificial victim, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				1008
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. πορφύρας</span>
			<i>dye</i> of the murex, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				960
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>oak-gall</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
				32
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.2.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.8.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.107
			</span></i>; <i>the dye made therefrom</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				27.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				43
			</span></i>; used as <i>ink</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				955.64
			</span></i>; esp. invisible ink, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				102.32
			</span></i>.</div>
